      "amount": "1/2 cup"
    },
    {
      "name": "olive oil",
      "amount": "1/4 cup"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Season the lamb shoulder with salt and whole black peppercorns.",
    "In a large Dutch oven, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Sear the lamb shoulder until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the onion, garlic, and ginger to the pot and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the long-fermentation-dough, dried apricots, and prunes to the pot.",
    "Cover the pot and transfer it to the preheated oven.",
    "Braise the tagine for 2.5 hours, or until the lamb is tender.",
    "Remove the pot from the oven and let it cool slightly.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
  ],
